# Test-Driven Development

1. **Features** — write implementation tests first (handler/service/repository)
2. **Bugs** — write regression test reproducing the bug, then fix
3. **HTTP modules** — use `httptest.NewRequest` + `app.Test()` (Fiber v3)

Every changed `.go` file (except `main.go`) needs a corresponding `*_test.go`.

Run `make ai-test-driven` and `make test` before finishing.
